Follow `.cursor/rules/newleaf-agent-guide.mdc` plus these split rules:

- `.cursor/rules/newleaf-architecture.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/newleaf-backend-patterns.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/newleaf-ui-patterns.mdc`
- `.cursor/rules/newleaf-agent-workflow.mdc`

Key rules:
- Timeline JSON and manifest sequence metadata are the source of truth.
- Never rely on HeyGen completion order or filesystem order.
- Do not mutate original uploaded media.
- Keep provider secrets in backend services only.
- Run `npm run check`, `npm test`, and `npm run build -w @newleaf/admin` before finishing code changes when practical.
